11. i-di-nu-szu-nu-ti-ma 
#tr.ts: i(d)dinūšunūtīma
#tr.en: have given justice to them:

12. sig-zalag2-{d}nanna _dumu_ {d}nanna-lu2-du10 
#tr.ts: sig-zalag-nanna mār nanna-lu-dug
#tr.en: (the complaint of) Sig-zalag-nanna son of Nanna-lu-dug

13. na-si-ih ap-lu-sa3 {disz}geme2-{d}utu 
#tr.ts: nasiḫ aplu(s)sa amat-šamaš
#tr.en: is rejected. Amat-šamaš her inheritance

14. a-sza-ar t,a3-bu-szi-im 
#tr.ts: ašar ṭābušim
